upgrading.syntax.octalPrefix
============================

`0o17` for `017`.

- `adopted`: written where the older way is found
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · PHP 8.1 · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `adopted`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `octal_notation` .[decision-facts]

```neon
upgrading:
	syntax:
		octalPrefix: adopted
```

```php .[before]
$mode = 0755;  // The octal number `0755` must be written `0o755`.
$zero = 0;
$flags = 0x1F;
```

```php .[after]
$mode = 0o755;
$zero = 0;
$flags = 0x1F;
```


